        "text": "The Metaverse envisions a future where users consume information in a fully immersive virtual real time and three dimensional interface. Some even believe that users might experience the Metaverse involving all five senses, making the Metaverse essentially an alternative reality. The Metaverse concept was coined by author Neal Stephenson in his 1992 science fiction novel Snow Crash. The term gained popularity over the last few years as the idea of a virtual reality based Internet of experience caught the public's imagination. Sales of virtual reality headsets increased and video games with virtual world elements became popular. These games provide the closest Metaverse experience for consumers today.",
